    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd535a3feec3391803bdffe4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但四周的赛马娘立刻理清需改进之处，\n并开始拟定下一场的对策。\n那个景象对她来说，就像是来自其他次元。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8456c123f2b4ddbee63260dcb11b99c66b51d58f74ecfed33269ee9dca616a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048423.json",
