      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:077688dfb091e311dfa54b60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己的脑袋装不进任何内容。\n说着难解用语的她们，就像是其他世界的人，\n完全无法理解……看起来好可怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a29ef273044da7adeb7da0e025b40621f5d59502840037adb77ec78c033de1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048423.json",
      "json_path": [
