    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1728eea54a38200f77042fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次的胜利一定是幸运加总起来的侥幸，\n下次八成会输，而且是以非常逊的方式。\n……因为自己是个傻瓜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b7923c69f625b31e4fe37f49f815001417acb03076bb2148c743672bf6ad55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0e2561c5c18cb08d65af16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
