    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22631caed80638bc8f3b7539",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "什么下次、什么最受瞩目，拜托别再说了。\n她畏缩的心听不见\n训练员建议跑“大阪杯”的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13ef2839a01483ac6b5675679d3f80ebbdf60e5a5a289ff6daff5a41563464de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1048af5eb2241c251840237a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・空空如也",
      "source_fingerprint": "101274c33a3b1f8a8a3a6a3b2e420f32a4630fe051c914466d892dfc2ebb4b66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
