    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7365c3e582e14056058b6317",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑完之后，她燃尽了全力，甚至无法开口。\n但她完全追不上其他人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "861e1e8fd61681582bce5ff381613ecdff8494d51bb5afc91d9f25d1f418dc35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048424.json",
      "json_path": [
