      "uid": "zhcn:97a78e2a0f71f7a1a2d4c1a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们头脑好、又有体力，对话内容也很难……\n与自己根本属于不同世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "408259f867366d70f697834b540fe4f15bb7ed35296bef11532c3407b1add031",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
