    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d0170a5d415f918f480b535",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到底，自己与朋友们相比，\n既不机灵，头脑又差。\n虽然训练员给了自己很多指导……",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a30e3314a753a91eb513a4a93729974b15892072dbabdecc4de60fa5505067",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
