    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aefbd4b9148aefc76c46e0e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但自己是个傻瓜，\n还是连自己有多傻都不知道的，最惨的傻瓜。\n东瀛佐敦露出了干笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10abce9352c1ef896187f28da3bb89e329c96d54804e69233c468a4d201391c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
