    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a1ddb9741fcb84fcee1253",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑完比赛后，气喘吁吁的东瀛佐敦。\n再次感受到古马级GⅠ，\n是怎样的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d4edd2dddedc9f15913f66f97f04af6ef89e33cd55f71af912d7c21bd96e34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
