    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7338f5be865a98b57fdba385",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但黄金船跑完比赛后仍精神十足！\n已经开始鼓动观众情绪了！\n讨厌～～～真令人火大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f492fceaf68602014aa8bc01c189d708416258c833c7fe0c97d7f0abf735fcca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
