    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ffa63c3a659f74d163202a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦对黄金船\n燃起了敌对意识。\n她的内心不再迷惘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3e2df6cb9e5631cf3cc8dd255e450373c7ae6fc1d1c93992f336af347b2bf9",
