      "uid": "zhcn:3eb35d8387d723e004b28227",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到这一幕，黄金船告诉她──\n“要一直当个傻瓜喔。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7a0a65eb1a8bea9c54844b2ac24d1c8df757f48af203a19e24d52cd92b7652",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
