      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但东瀛佐敦只理解了字面上的意思，\n气到不行。\n这场较量就留待“宝冢纪念”继续了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b28cab5f84118af62f63820eb9dd1533335b14845f18380c3b6a58a8ea907d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
