    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d0f441170b37e89486a140e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“最强的傻瓜很帅气。”\n因为训练员这么说了，\n东瀛佐敦全力奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04573c68f09ca8a4f95a6f12d3542d6db1a1d294862ade69a5bda8bae2177c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048427.json",
      "json_path": [
