      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7fb8644aefb262fb94159de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份斗志也传染给了中山庆典。她说：\n“我要以世界为目标。\n你也来场只有你办得到的大博弈吧。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b2a8a14f6f01dd1cb3fc3a27a1be56def6e8cfe059d4ecff55ab8d33b2ac17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
