      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9704212fa6ec943c6fc3d5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这句话后，东瀛佐敦开始思考。\n如果要以最强为目标，\n她想跑得比历史上的……传说中的赛马娘更快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d2c8e100f49d7415d68a61bf8b2d3c581ebd0123771ca713b15a529a61ca0ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
