      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但黄金船拒绝了。她说：\n“那不是我的比赛，而是你的比赛。”\n没错，“天皇赏（秋）”是属于东瀛佐敦的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f35100eb095b50b572cb2593610e1991d191553250c65a7154c527791018071b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f98341c8dd40fc87677e515",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・你会笑我吗？",
