    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e133abbddfb8faebef177196",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到朋友的声援后，东瀛佐敦\n在“天皇赏（秋）”的舞台上得到了冠军。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffdce26c0513e7e8fb29b7629b2298d3573ea14a311ae542f57a44b1d611b148",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
