      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会场一片惊叹，喧腾的欢呼与掌声，\n丝毫不见停歇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30188807c73912faeac20de24b3a3de19ca29c62f8152efd18e97d51fe6e6a45",
