    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dbee0c675690eca882b2455",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是最强的傻瓜对吧？\n东瀛佐敦\n对训练员露出了微笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c949020d08f661215af78f333162b4d664686c8005be9bf15a98f5a4411ae91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048428.json",
      "json_path": [
